sequenceDiagram
    participant Bun as bun run build
    participant Vite as vite build
    participant SSR as vite SSR
    participant Render as entry-server.render
    participant Purge as PurgeCSS
    participant Beasties as Beasties
    participant FS as build/

    Bun ->> Vite: emit JS, CSS, manifest
    Vite -->> Bun: index.html template
    Bun ->> SSR: load entry-server.tsx
    SSR ->> Render: render each route
    Render -->> Bun: HTML strings
    Bun ->> Bun: rewrite dev asset paths
    Bun ->> Bun: stamp body class per route
    Bun ->> Purge: scan HTML, src, reactstrap
    Purge -->> Bun: stripped main CSS
    loop each route
        Bun ->> Beasties: inline critical CSS
        Beasties -->> FS: route index.html
    end
